WEBVTT

00:01:28.786 --> 00:01:30.192
eshte se ka mjaft pluhur te mbetur

00:01:30.192 --> 00:01:32.158
sa qe nuk formon nje yll

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.158
por behet nje planet.

00:01:34.158 --> 00:01:38.983
Dhe kjo ndodhi pak me shume se 4 miliarde vite me pare.

00:01:38.983 --> 00:01:40.416
Dhe pas nje kohe

00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:42.333
ka ende material te mbetur

00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:46.896
qe mundeson te marresh nje "supe fillestare"

00:01:46.896 --> 00:01:48.660
e cila krijon jete.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:52.541
Dhe jeta fillon te zgjerohet e zgjerohet e zgjerohet

00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:54.292
derisa eshte kaput.

00:01:54.292 --> 00:01:57.780
(Te qeshura)

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.210
Ne fakt, gjeja me e cuditshme

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:02.116
eshte se jeta behet kaput, jo nje here, as dy here,